# winex11, wineandroid: Use the default implementation for ShowWindow.
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/11626 state=opened
# The wineandroid implementation already seem to match the default one, the winex11 implementation was checking current_event, which shouldn't be necessary anymore, as well as some extra heuristics introduced in 6f2c18609b27a4fe80f3e538e2454579d8d6b3aa which I don't fully understand. It seems to decide to keep minimized window at their current position in non-virtual desktop mode, or if system tray isn't visible. I don't understand why, or why it should be winex11 specific, and if we want to keep that we could probably move it to win32u.
